* @title Gimpel generated stack functions
* @attribution James F. Gimpel, Algorithms in SNOBOL4, Chapter 14.8; Catspaw SNOBOL4+ program diskette
* @expect >>>
* CHANGED
* ONE
* RED
* <<<
-INCLUDE "STACK.INC"
	STACK('A')
	STACK('B')
	PUSHA('ONE')
	PUSHA('TWO')
	PUSHB('RED')
	TOPA() = 'CHANGED'
	OUTPUT = POPA()
	OUTPUT = POPA()
	OUTPUT = POPB()
END
